---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer id="about" class="border-t border-white/[0.06] py-10">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4 text-center">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-text-secondary">
        About me — I run Arch-based KDE Linux and I'm picky about my tools.
        Every app here earned its place by being better than the alternatives
        I tried.
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/goodborn"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="rounded-lg border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.03] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-text-secondary transition-all duration-200 hover:border-glow-purple/30 hover:text-text-primary hover:shadow-glow-sm"
        >
          GitHub Profile
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/goodborn/ckedps-personal"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="rounded-lg border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.03] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-text-secondary transition-all duration-200 hover:border-glow-purple/30 hover:text-text-primary hover:shadow-glow-sm"
        >
          CKDEPS Repo
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-text-dim">
        © {year} Goodborn · Crafted with <span class="text-glow-purple">♥</span> and questionable amounts of caffeine
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>